{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Methods"}], "prev": {"link": "../get_users/", "title": "get_users()"}, "next": {"link": "../get_chat_audios_count/", "title": "get_chat_audios_count()"}, "title": "get_chat_audios()", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"get-chat-audios\">\n<h1>get_chat_audios()<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#get-chat-audios\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.Client.get_chat_audios\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_chat_audios</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.get_chat_audios\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get a user profile audios sequentially.</p>\n<strong>Usable by</strong>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Users</span>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Bots</span><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>chat_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> | <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 Unique identifier (int) or username (str) of the target chat.\nFor your personal cloud (Saved Messages) you can simply use \u201cme\u201d or \u201cself\u201d.\nFor a contact that exists in your Telegram address book you can use his phone number (str).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>offset</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Sequential number of the first audio to be returned. By default, all audios are returned.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>limit</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Limits the number of audios to be retrieved.\nBy default, no limit is applied and all profile audios are returned.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Generator</span></code> \u2013 A generator yielding <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/Audio/#pyrogram.types.Audio\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Audio\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Audio</span></code></a> objects.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">async</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">audio</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">app</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_chat_audios</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;me&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">audio</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/methods/get_chat_audios_count", "get_chat_audios_count()", "N", "next"], ["api/methods/get_users", "get_users()", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">get_chat_audios()</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.get_chat_audios\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.get_chat_audios()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/methods/get_chat_audios", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}